PCF_Ratio": 16.38}}');
INSERT INTO public.funds (productnum, tickersym, quotemode, geozone, shortlabel, fulldescription, currencybase, strategytype, capsize, parentgroup, listingvenue, productclass, networth, yieldrate, launchdate, turnoverratio, strategynotes, expensenet, benchmarkexp, vol3m, volrecent, ma50, ma200, equityweight, bondweight, pb_ratio, pcf_ratio, pe_ratio, ps_ratio, avgmaturity, duration, fundclass, fundmetrics, tradingdata, allocweights, valuationratios) VALUES (628, 'FIGB', 'ETF', 'U.S.A.', 'American Century High Yield - ', 'American Century High-Yield Fund C Class', 'AmericanDollar', NULL, NULL, 'American Century Investments', 'PCX', 'Intermediate-Term Bond', 10075996, NULL, '2021-03-02', NULL, 'The investment seeks high current income; capital appreciation is the secondary objective. The portfolio managers will maintain at least 80% of the fund''s net assets in high-yield corporate bonds and other debt instruments. The remaining assets may be invested in common stocks or other equity-related securities. Up to 40% of the fund''s total assets may be invested in fixed-income obligations of foreign issuers. It may invest up to 20% of its assets in short-term money market instruments and U.S. government securities. The fund has no average maturity limitations, but it typically invests in intermediate-term and long-term debt securities.', 0.0036, 0.0023, 622, 1270, 50.25, 50.274, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 6.54, '{"Cap_Size": null, "Quote_Mode": "ETF", "Currency_Base": "AmericanDollar", "GeoZone_Class": "U.S.A.", "Strategy_Type": null}', '{"Net_Worth": 10075996, "Yield_Rate": null, "Expense_Net": 0.0036, "Benchmark_Exp": 0.0023, "Turnover_Ratio": null}', '{"volume_metrics": {"Vol_3M": 622, "Vol_Recent": 1270}, "moving_averages": {"MA_50": 50.25, "MA_200": 50.274}}', '{"asset_allocation": {"Bond_Weight": null, "Equity_Weight": null}, "bond_characteristics": {"Avg_Maturity": null, "Duration_Yrs": 6.54}}', '{"valuation_metrics": {"PB_Ratio": null, "PE_Ratio": null, "PS_Ratio": null, "PCF_Ratio": null}}');
INSERT INTO public.funds (productnum, tickersym, quotemode, geozone, shortlabel, fulldescription, currencybase, strategytype, capsize, parentgroup, listingvenue, productclass, networth, yieldrate, launchdate, turnoverratio, strategynotes, expensenet, benchmarkexp, vol3m, volrecent, ma50, ma200, equityweight, bondweight, pb_ratio, pcf_ratio, pe_ratio, ps_ratio, avgmaturity, duration, fundclass, fundmetrics, tradingdata, allocweights, valuationratios) VALUES (629, 'FINX', 'ETF', 'America', 'American Century Heritage - C C', 'American Century Heritage Fund C Class', 'US$', 'Growth', 'Large', 'American Century Investments', 'NGM', 'Technology', 1313370368, NULL, '2016-09-12', NULL, 'The investment seeks long-term capital growth. The fund normally invests in stocks of medium-sized companies that the adviser believes will increase in value over time, using an investment strategy developed by the fund''s investment advisor. In implementing this strategy, the portfolio managers make their investment decisions based primarily on their analysis of individual companies, rather than on broad economic forecasts. Management of the fund is based on the belief that durable franchises in a growing industry can sustain above average earnings growth.', 0.0068, 0.0053, 215267, 433880, 49.634, 47.721, 0.9994, 0, 6.41, 29.6, 40.92, 7.27, NULL, NULL, '{"Cap_Size": "Large", "Quote_Mode": "ETF", "Currency_Base": "US$", "GeoZone_Class": "America", "Strategy_Type": "Growth"}', '{"Net_Worth": 1313370368, "Yield_Rate": null, "Expense_Net": 0.0068, "Benchmark_Exp": 0.0053, "Turnover_Ratio": null}', '{"volume_metrics": {"Vol_3M": 215267, "Vol_Recent": 433880}, "moving_averages": {"MA_50": 49.634, "MA_200": 47.721}}', '{"asset_allocation": {"Bond_Weight": 0, "Equity_Weight": 0.9994}, "bond_characteristics": {"Avg_Maturity": null, "Duration_Yrs": null}}', '{"valuation_metrics": {"PB_Ratio": 6.41, "PE_Ratio": 40.92, "PS_Ratio": 7.27, "PCF_Ratio": 29.6}}');
INSERT INTO public.funds (productnum, tickersym, quotemode, geozone, shortlabel, fulldescription, currencybase, strategytype, capsize, parentgroup, listingvenue, productclass, networth, yieldrate, launchdate, turnoverratio, strategynotes, expensenet, benchmarkexp, vol3m, volrecent, ma50, ma200, equityweight, bondweight, pb_ratio, pcf_ratio, pe_ratio, ps_ratio, avgmaturity, duration, fundclass, fundmetrics, tradingdata, allocweights, valuationratios) VALUES (630, 'FISR', 'ETF', 'U.S.A.', 'NT High Income Fund - G Class', 'American Century NT High Income Fund G Class', 'US Dollar', NULL, NULL, 'American Century Investments', 'PCX', 'Multisector Bond', 82034008, 0.0245, '2019-04-02', 1.5, 'The investment seeks current yield and capital growth. Under normal market conditions, the fund invests primarily in high-yield corporate bonds and other debt instruments with an emphasis on those that are rated below investment-grade. A high-yield security, or junk bond, is one that has been rated below the four highest categories used by a nationally recognized statistical rating organization, or, if unrated, determined by the investment advisor to be of similar quality. Generally, the fund invests in U.S. dollar denominated securities; however, the fund may invest in securities denominated in foreign currencies.', 0.005, 0.008, 31441, 32380, 31.116, 31.147, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 11.44, 8.43, '{"Cap_Size": null, "Quote_Mode": "ETF", "Currency_Base": "US Dollar", "GeoZone_Class": "U.S.A.", "Strategy_Type": null}', '{"Net_Worth": 82034008, "Yield_Rate": 0.0245, "Expense_Net": 0.005, "Benchmark_Exp": 0.008, "Turnover_Ratio": 1.5}', '{"volume_metrics": {"Vol_3M": 31441, "Vol_Recent": 32380}, "moving_averages": {"MA_50": 31.116, "MA_200": 31.147}}', '{"asset_allocation": {"Bond_Weight": null, "Equity_Weight": null}, "bond_characteristics": {"Avg_Maturity": 11.44, "Duration_Yrs": 8.43}}', '{"valuation_metrics": {"PB_Ratio": null, "PE_Ratio": null, "PS_Ratio": null, "PCF_Ratio": null}}');
