tio": null, "PCF_Ratio": null}}');
INSERT INTO public.funds (productnum, tickersym, quotemode, geozone, shortlabel, fulldescription, currencybase, strategytype, capsize, parentgroup, listingvenue, productclass, networth, yieldrate, launchdate, turnoverratio, strategynotes, expensenet, benchmarkexp, vol3m, volrecent, ma50, ma200, equityweight, bondweight, pb_ratio, pcf_ratio, pe_ratio, ps_ratio, avgmaturity, duration, fundclass, fundmetrics, tradingdata, allocweights, valuationratios) VALUES (1265, 'MTGP', 'ETF', 'USA', 'Invesco Asia Pacific Growth Fun', 'Invesco Asia Pacific Growth Fund Class R6', 'DOLLAR', NULL, NULL, 'Invesco', 'PCX', 'Intermediate Government', 35602812, 0.0174, '2019-11-12', 2.78, 'The investment seeks long-term growth of capital. The fund invests at least 80% of its net assets (plus any borrowings for investment purposes) in securities of issuers in the Asia Pacific region (except Japanese issuers), and in derivatives and other instruments that have economic characteristics similar to such securities. It invests primarily in equity securities and depositary receipts. The fund may invest in the securities of issuers of all capitalization sizes and may invest a significant amount of its net assets in the securities of small- and mid-capitalization issuers. The fund''s common stock investments also include China-A shares.', 0.0045, 0.0011, 4461, 2660, 50.566, 50.865, 0, 0.9973, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"Cap_Size": null, "Quote_Mode": "ETF", "Currency_Base": "DOLLAR", "GeoZone_Class": "USA", "Strategy_Type": null}', '{"Net_Worth": 35602812, "Yield_Rate": 0.0174, "Expense_Net": 0.0045, "Benchmark_Exp": 0.0011, "Turnover_Ratio": 2.78}', '{"volume_metrics": {"Vol_3M": 4461, "Vol_Recent": 2660}, "moving_averages": {"MA_50": 50.566, "MA_200": 50.865}}', '{"asset_allocation": {"Bond_Weight": 0.9973, "Equity_Weight": 0}, "bond_characteristics": {"Avg_Maturity": null, "Duration_Yrs": null}}', '{"valuation_metrics": {"PB_Ratio": null, "PE_Ratio": null, "PS_Ratio": null, "PCF_Ratio": null}}');
INSERT INTO public.funds (productnum, tickersym, quotemode, geozone, shortlabel, fulldescription, currencybase, strategytype, capsize, parentgroup, listingvenue, productclass, networth, yieldrate, launchdate, turnoverratio, strategynotes, expensenet, benchmarkexp, vol3m, volrecent, ma50, ma200, equityweight, bondweight, pb_ratio, pcf_ratio, pe_ratio, ps_ratio, avgmaturity, duration, fundclass, fundmetrics, tradingdata, allocweights, valuationratios) VALUES (1266, 'MTUL', 'ETF', 'U.S.', 'Strategic Income Fund - R Class', 'American Century Strategic Income Fund R Class', 'Usd', NULL, NULL, 'American Century Investments', 'PCX', 'Trading--Leveraged Equity', 24834700, NULL, '2021-02-04', NULL, 'The investment seeks income; long-term capital appreciation is the secondary consideration. The fund invests in both investment-grade and high-yield, non-money market debt securities. These securities may include corporate bonds and notes, government securities and securities backed by mortgages or other assets. The fund may also invest in certain equity securities such as preferred stock, convertible securities or equity equivalents provided that such investments are consistent with the fund''s investment objectives.', 0.0095, 0.009, 958, 2620, 28.214, 25.203, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"Cap_Size": null, "Quote_Mode": "ETF", "Currency_Base": "Usd", "GeoZone_Class": "U.S.", "Strategy_Type": null}', '{"Net_Worth": 24834700, "Yield_Rate": null, "Expense_Net": 0.0095, "Benchmark_Exp": 0.009, "Turnover_Ratio": null}', '{"volume_metrics": {"Vol_3M": 958, "Vol_Recent": 2620}, "moving_averages": {"MA_50": 28.214, "MA_200": 25.203}}', '{"asset_allocation": {"Bond_Weight": null, "Equity_Weight": null}, "bond_characteristics": {"Avg_Maturity": null, "Duration_Yrs": null}}', '{"valuation_metrics": {"PB_Ratio": null, "PE_Ratio": null, "PS_Ratio": null, "PCF_Ratio": null}}');
